{"parse": {"title": "箱装印象", "pageid": 144225, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"箱装印象\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e0/Item-823852.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"箱装印象\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>箱装印象</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#823852</div></div><hr /><div>缭绕着雾气的箱式相簿。获取时可随机获得岩、星、木、兽、灵·智五种箱装印象中的一种。开启后可从中挑选指定灵感的6星角色到访。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">如何得悉它天生各异的效用，又如何识见那一闪即逝的辉光？驱散迷雾，瞧瞧吧——那是你有着各色奇妙天赋的朋友。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "箱装印象"}}